Answer: As of October 2020, the estimated global infection fatality rate (IFR) of COVID-19 was **0.15–0.20%** (0.03–0.04% in those under 70 years), according to the source, which states: "About 10%of the global population may be infected by October 2020. Global infection fatality rate is 0.15-0.20% (0.03-0.04% in those <70 years)."

